7	 * application code of its own — it is a branded, self-updating shell.
8	 *
9	 * If the build was produced with local AI enabled, a native LiteRT-LM server
10	 * (Gemma 4 E4B) is started on loopback and advertised to the page via URL
11	 * params, so the web app can route AI through the local model.
12	 *
13	 * Point the window at a local dev server by setting TWYNE_DESKTOP_URL, e.g.
14	 *   TWYNE_DESKTOP_URL=http://localhost:5173 bun start
15	 */
